                  "italic": null,
                  "language": "en-IN",
                  "size_pt": 18.0,
                  "underline": null
                },
                "text": "That this philosophy has held India together and seen her through many upheavals – political, social, economic, intellectual, is brought to the fore when Max Muller, the famous scholar and Orientalist, remarks, ‘"
              },
              {
                "style": {
                  "alignment": "l",
                  "bold": true,
                  "color": "#FFFFFF",
                  "font_family": "Trebuchet MS",
                  "italic": true,
                  "language": "en-IN",
                  "size_pt": 18.0,
                  "underline": null
                },
                "text": "There is, in fact, an unbroken continuity between the most modern and the most ancient phases of Hindu thought, extending over more than three thousand years"
              },
              {
                "style": {
                  "alignment": "l",
                  "bold": null,
                  "color": "#FFFFFF",
                  "font_family": "Trebuchet MS",
                  "italic": null,
                  "language": "en-IN",
                  "size_pt": 18.0,
                  "underline": null
                },
                "text": ".’"
              }
            ],
            "style": {
              "alignment": "l",
              "bold": null,
              "color": "#FFFFFF",
              "font_family": "Trebuchet MS",
              "italic": null,
              "language": null,
              "size_pt": 18.0,
              "underline": null
            },
            "text": "That this philosophy has held India together and seen her through many upheavals – political, social, economic, intellectual, is brought to the fore when Max Muller, the famous scholar and Orientalist, remarks, ‘There is, in fact, an unbroken continuity between the most modern and the most ancient phases of Hindu thought, extending over more than three thousand years.’"
          },
